Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,An AML alert is a question, not a conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.90,0:00:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,SignalFlow is a synthetic-data investigation prototype for the Global AI Hackathon's\NAI Agents and Intelligent Systems challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.50,0:00:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Every record, score, and event in this workspace is fictional.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.30,0:00:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the sample case.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Its score prioritizes review. It does not establish wrongdoing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.70,0:00:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,For this verified run, the bounded agent uses GPT-6.1 Sol\Nthrough the current Manus model gateway.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.10,0:00:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Its only tools read synthetic signals, identify missing context,\Nand retrieve a sample review checklist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.90,0:00:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is the live tool trace returned by the server.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The model drafts a next step, but an analyst owns the decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.30,0:00:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The agent cannot access a bank system, search the web, or change a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.30,0:00:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This video verifies one synthetic-case run.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.20,0:00:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It does not prove AML performance or production readiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The public GitHub Pages site remains deterministic\Nand makes no model call.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.50,0:00:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The agent runs locally with an explicitly configured compatible provider.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.40,0:01:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,SignalFlow's original interface began in the separate\NAzentio AI Build Labs project.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.40,0:01:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The bounded agent adaptation was added for the Global AI Hackathon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.80,0:01:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That history is disclosed.
